WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.390
<i>Episode 8</i>

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:14.160
So you are feeling lion-hearted, hm?
How dare you stand in my way...

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:20.180
Beauty Chu, His Highness ordered me
not to admit anyone to see him today.

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:23.390
I am His Highness' favorite 
concubine. Move aside!

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:25.890
P-Please do not make this difficult for me...

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.100
Your Highness, are you off to visit someone?

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:36.890
Please take me with you.

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:39.890
Business. Not convenient.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:43.270
Your Highness!

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:45.740
Your Highness!

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:52.900
In the past, Prince Ye loved only Beauty Chu,
 but see how she is treated now.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.770
Look at the color her face has turned.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.890
I am sorry I hurt you, mistress. I deserve death!

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.340
Even you dare to hurt me?

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.350
Get out!

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:17.760
Yes, mistress.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.600
Get out! All of you! Get out!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:28.100
Get out!

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.250
What has happened?

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.100
Who has angered you so, 
Little Sister Jiao'er?

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.470
Have my elder sisters come to mock me?

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:46.910
Little sister appears to be in a bad mood.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.290
Is it because His Highness has a new favorite?

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.600
A new favorite?!

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:54.600
A few days ago, His Highness 
brought two girls back with him.

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:59.200
Two little girls have usurped <i>me</i>, Chu Jiao'er?

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:04.120
One of them is in fact 
Princess Ye, Qian Yunshang.

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:04.870
What?!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:12.640
Does she not reside in the Serenity Pavilion?

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.000
Why would he...

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:17.980
Are you all right, little sister?

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.920
She is restless with ambition and cunning.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:27.350
I do not know what witchcraft she has used 
to suddenly attract the gaze of His Highness.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:32.540
We were all sent here by the empress 
dowager, but your route was different.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.800
You were brought here 
by His Highness himself.

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:38.220
His Highness loved you from the 
moment you set foot in the palace.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:43.550
His sudden loss of interest in you
must be related to Princess Ye.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:48.750
You were orphaned. You rely solely 
on His Highness for food and shelter.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.250
If you fall out of favor...

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.330
Our families can still support us,

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:55.550
but my poor little sister, you have no one else...

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.570
<i>Qian Yunshang!</i>

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.930
Don't hide. Let me put it on you.

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:16.240
My lady, I cannot wear this.
If someone sees, I will be in trouble—

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:17.930
It looks good on you.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:19.530
Come on.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.310
Enjoy your self-satisfaction while you can.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:38.040
Once Father finds Auntie Xue, 
I'll take you to Spirit Cloud Mountain.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:40.750
The fish there look even 
better than the ones here.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:43.310
But Auntie Xue was gravely ill 
and did not know what ailed her...

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:45.580
No problem.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:49.680
My master lives on Spirit Cloud Mountain.
He'll definitely be able to cure Auntie Xue.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:50.310
All right.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.310
My lady!

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.620
My lady!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.560
Mistress, are you all right?

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.560
Forgive... Forgive me.

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:25.310
Que'er!

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:27.000
Who are you?

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.610
I'm the one who splashed you.
 Why'd you kick my maid?!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.000
You do not know who you address.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:37.170
Our mistress is Beauty Chu,
the most beloved in the palace.

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:38.560
So what if she kicked a maid?

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:41.440
Qiuzhu, do not be so rude.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:42.810
She is Princess Ye, after all.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:44.810
Yes, mistress.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:48.030
So you're Beauty Chu? 
I'm sorry for splashing you.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:51.660
It is fine. A little dirty water, nothing more.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:52.430
My lady...

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.330
Beauty Chu is merciful.

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:56.700
Que'er, let's go.

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:01.680
Wait.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:08.680
A maid wearing a flower hairpin
is a transgression of the rules.

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:15.180
I placed the hairpin in my maid's
 hair. Why should <i>you</i> care?

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:20.370
This is not about my mistress, 
but the rules of the palace.

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:24.770
Since His Highness lets me manage the palace,

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.360
I do not dare overlook this.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:31.850
Please do not make this
difficult for me, princess.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.080
Qiuzhu, slap her face.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.030
Yes, mistress.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:40.890
Don't you dare!

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:45.450
If you want to talk rules, I'm the 
princess and you're just a concubine.

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:47.620
So you should be listening to <i>me</i>.

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:49.910
You didn't bow or kneel when you saw me,

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:51.540
so shouldn't I be punishing you?

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.100
You are nothing but a title.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.120
You really think you matter?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.100
My lady...

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.710
Mistress Yunxi!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.100
It's fine as long as she doesn't bully anyone.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:05.830
<i><i>Stop talking crap and help me out like before.</i></i>

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:11.910
Since Beauty Chu is so strict 
about the palace rules,

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.810
I won't argue any longer.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.930
If you must punish her, go ahead.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:17.850
Qiuzhu.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:19.120
Yes, mistress.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.200
Stop!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:30.370
Stop immediately!

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.830
My... My face...

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:37.520
Are you okay, mistress?

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:39.520
Why would Beauty Chu's face be...

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:41.520
<i><i>You did great!</i></i>

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:44.020
When don't we?

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:51.500
Excellent work.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:56.570
With such fine horses, we can be more 
confident of winning a battle with the West.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:57.760
Your praise honors me.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:02.610
If His Imperial Majesty permits it, 
increased breeding will yield more gains.

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:03.680
But thus far...

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.940
Father should be supporting us,

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.520
but it would be politically 
inconvenient to do so directly.

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:13.330
Then, what should we do? 
Continue breeding them at a snail's pace?

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:16.620
Lanshuang's birthday is in two days.
Everyone will be there to celebrate it.

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:21.020
If we can get his permission then,
everything will run more smoothly.

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:29.520
You... What kind of witchcraft did you use?!

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:34.220
Since you're done slapping and enforcing
 the rules, this matter ends here.

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.180
We're leaving.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:39.150
Stop... Stop them!

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:42.890
Your Highness, please stay.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.180
What makes you think you can stop me?

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.580
You witch...

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.340
You are going nowhere 
until you explain everything!

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.180
Why is it so noisy here?

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.400
Greetings, Your Highness.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.180
Greetings, General Xuan.

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:07.970
<i><i>Mochi? Sesame? </i></i>

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:09.490
<i><i>What's wrong?</i></i>

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:12.630
Your Highness...

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:22.680
My lady, we should greet them, too.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.680
What happened to your face?

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:27.600
I was taking a turn around the garden,

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:32.510
and I do not know how I offended the princess, 
but she splashed me with dirty water.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.680
And that is not all.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:37.200
The princess also used witchcraft to hurt me.

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:38.030
Witchcraft?

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:42.220
I saw her maid, Que'er, wearing flowers,
 a transgression of the rules.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:47.120
So I bade Qiuzhu to slap her. I do not know
 why I was the one who was harmed...

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.750
Please, Your Highness, get justice for me.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.600
It is true, Your Highness.
We saw it with our own eyes.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:55.040
I definitely slapped the maid, Que'er.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:58.910
I do not know what the princess did,
but my mistress' face was struck instead.

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:00.090
I see.

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:03.640
Tie up the maid, Que'er,
and slap her thirty times.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:07.230
Wait. For what reason?
This is unprovoked assault!

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.520
For what reason?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:13.640
You choose to defy me over a maid?

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:18.270
This is also the quickest 
way to verify the claims.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:22.140
If I want her dead, she will not see tomorrow.

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:29.140
Do not be angry, Your Highness! It was all
my fault! Please do not blame the princess!

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:32.870
Slap her face now.

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:35.280
Yes, Your Highness.

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:54.640
I am unharmed.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:01.640
Let me go!

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:09.720
I splashed the water and put the
 flower in her hair. I did all of it.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:13.020
It has nothing to do with Que'er. 
If you want to punish someone, punish me.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.210
Do not be angry, Highness.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:20.000
The princess' status is noble and mine is low.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.020
How could I subject the 
princess to such a grievance?

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:24.780
There are rules within the palace.

00:12:25.150 --> 00:12:28.310
They apply to everyone equally,
regardless of title or status.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:33.370
Beauty Chu can overlook what happened,
and plead on the princess' behalf.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.520
She is a model of virtue.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.550
Your praise honors me, General Xuan.

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:42.380
See, Brother Ye?

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:46.450
There is no witchcraft, and Beauty Chu
has chosen to let the matter rest.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:49.680
Plus, the maid has been slapped. 
Why not drop the matter?

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:53.310
I... That is not <i>quite</i> what I meant...

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:58.100
Beauty Chu, you are so dignified and generous.

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:00.600
Were you not trying to turn 
a major dispute into a minor one?

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:03.700
Of course.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:07.180
I hope His Highness can forgive the princess...

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:09.570
Then, all is well.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:15.030
The punishment has been carried out.
I also admire your noble morals.

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:20.390
B-But... if Your Highness insists
 on punishing the princess,

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:23.950
I would not dare to oppose 
Your Highness' judgment.

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:28.640
As you wish to drop the matter,
I have no desire to spend more time on it.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:33.140
I will overlook it this time.

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:36.140
You are merciful, Highness!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:38.570
Princess...

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:40.140
Let's go.

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:45.020
Stop.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.490
Did I say you could leave?

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.750
We are no longer needed. Why can't we leave?

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:56.020
Lock the princess in the firewood storehouse 
for three days to reflect on her actions.

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:00.100
Relay the following order:

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:03.730
No one may bring them 
food for those three days.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:04.530
Yes, mistress.

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.370
Que'er, are you okay?

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:10.680
It was only a few slaps. Nothing major.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.930
I swear to you, I <i>will</i> get justice for you!

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:19.310
My lady, I do not need justice.
Please do not offend others again.

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:21.070
But Que'er...

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:22.630
My lady...

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:24.820
My life is worthless.

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:28.050
You must not enrage the prince for my sake.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:32.830
In the palace, His Highness is
 the only one you can rely on.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.850
You have to learn to endure.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.850
Please, I beg you...

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:41.490
Mistress Yunxi!

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.200
Sesame? Mochi?

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:47.080
My lady, who are you talking to?

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.060
Mistress Yunxi, are you all right?

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:54.590
Awesome! You guys brought food!

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.540
The food flew out of thin air!

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:01.620
Less gawping, more eating.

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:03.770
Hold up, I have something 
important to tell you.

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:06.340
I'm sure of it now.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.410
The one restricting my power is Ye Youming.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:11.640
Whenever he's present, 
I can't use my powers.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:16.410
You need to find a way to get close to him
 and see if he has a gold ring inlaid with jade.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:19.120
It'll have a dragon pattern 
engraved on the inside of it.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:21.640
What?

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:24.390
Get close to him? Not happening!

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.520
He saved you before.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.890
Can't you just bury the hatchet?

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:42.330
Okay, since you guys 
remembered to bring me food,

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.050
I'll keep my eye out for it.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:45.020
Great!

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:54.820
Qiuzhu, do you understand 
why you are being punished?

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:56.850
I do... understand...

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:01.050
It is all... the princess' fault!

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:01.840
Correct.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:06.020
All right, you may stop.
Come, clean and dress me.

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:06.770
Yes, mistress.

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:11.640
That unloved princess deserves to be 
locked in the firewood storehouse.

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:14.530
Despite being the most 
favored in the palace,

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.910
I still must be extremely
respectful to His Highness.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:20.560
She dares to offend him again and again, 
and thinks too highly of herself.

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:24.630
Well, I think she will not draw attention 
to herself so much from now on.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.290
Still, we must never lower our guard.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:30.140
I shall expose her witchcraft
 in front of His Highness,

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:32.530
so that His Highness will divorce her.

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:37.140
Could some aberration have latched on to her 
when she resided in the Serenity Pavilion?

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:38.920
The Serenity Pavilion?

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:42.590
Qiuzhu, you will go to the 
Taoist Temple tomorrow,

00:16:42.590 --> 00:16:45.980
and invite all the most famous 
Taoists here on my behalf.

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:49.050
Yes, mistress. I will go do so in the morning.

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:56.020
What is it? Is what I said 
still not clear enough?

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:57.710
I do not understand, Highness.

00:16:58.310 --> 00:17:02.580
You wished to interrogate the princess
before, yet now, you desire an investigation.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.640
This is most...

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:09.140
Do I have to explain everything?
Just follow my instructions.

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:10.640
Yes, Highness.

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:17.100
Psychic Princess stops airing next week

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:17.100
Notice of a pause in airing

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:21.180
The production team is taking a break
due to the Chinese New Year

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:24.520
They are hiding to master their dancing skills

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:28.020
They've closed the door to research how to be funny

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:31.600
They are working hard to maintain 
and improve the quality of each scene

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:43.180
Therefore, the animation known as "Psychic Princess"

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:43.180
will stop airing on January 25th,

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:43.180
and resume again March 1st

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:48.680
Everyone, please wait patiently for 
the Ye Princely Palace to return! (Bow)
